<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body class="week_space-page">
    <header>
        <h1><%= title %></h1>
    </header>
    <nav>
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <a href="/areas">Areas</a>
        <a href="/faq">FAQ</a>
        <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
        <a href="/special-events">Events</a>
    </nav>
    <main>
        <div class="text-box space-adventure-text">
            <h2>Adventure Week in Space</h2>
            <p>"Blast off into a week-long celebration of the cosmos with thrilling space-themed shows and activities. Immerse yourself in the wonders of the universe with everything from captivating live performances and interactive exhibits to cosmic games and stargazing events. This event provides a unique opportunity to explore the mysteries of space in an exciting and educational setting, making it ideal for aspiring astronauts and space enthusiasts!"</p>
        
            <button class="check-availability-btn" onclick="checkAvailability()">Check Availability</button>
        
            <!-- Availability Message Container -->
            <div id="availability-message" class="availability-message" style="display:none;">
                <p><strong>Good news! There is availability for this event.</strong></p>
                <p>To make a booking, please call us at <a href="tel:01616849254">0161 684 9254</a> or visit our <a href="/contact">Contact Page</a> to submit a request form. We look forward to hearing from you!</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>
    <footer class="footer-container">
        <div>
            <p>&copy; 2024 Theme Park. All Rights Reserved.</p>
        </div>
        <script>
            function checkAvailability() {
                // Display the availability message
                document.getElementById('availability-message').style.display = 'block';
            }
        </script>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>